WEBVTT

00:12:59.881 --> 00:13:01.056
I did better.

00:13:01.080 --> 00:13:04.439
All this choice made it possible
for me to do better.

00:13:04.909 --> 00:13:06.060
But --

00:13:06.084 --> 00:13:07.504
I felt worse.

00:13:08.544 --> 00:13:12.317
Why? I wrote a whole book
to try to explain this to myself.

00:13:12.341 --> 00:13:13.500
The reason is --

00:13:13.524 --> 00:13:17.721
(Laughter)

00:13:17.745 --> 00:13:22.759
The reason I felt worse is that
with all of these options available,

00:13:22.783 --> 00:13:28.171
my expectations about how good
a pair of jeans should be went up.

00:13:29.092 --> 00:13:33.546
I had very low, no particular expectations
when they only came in one flavor.